# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secret hygiene: nothing generated at deploy time may ever enter version
# control. Patterns are **/-prefixed so they apply inside both local/ and
# cloud/ (each is a self-contained project with its own terraform/ + ansible/).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Terraform working dirs, lock files (per-OS), and state (environment-specific).
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Real variable files (only the *.example is committed).
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars

# Terraform -> Ansible handover artefact, written from TF state at apply time.
**/ansible/inventory/hosts.yml

# Deploy-time secrets: generated passwords live here and nowhere else.
**/.secrets/

# Deploy-time PKI: the internal CA and all leaf certificates/keys.
**/.certs/

# Vendored Ansible collections and bookkeeping.
**/ansible/collections/
**/*.retry

# Cloud: SSH known_hosts captured at deploy time, the API token, and any
# diagnostics captured on a failed run.
**/.ssh_known_hosts
cloud/.env
cloud/diagnostics/

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
